                  {
                    "type": "code",
                    "text": "c4e4f9b"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", not a live feed. Each record's default geometry is Quattroshapes, sourced from the U.S. Census Bureau — the same provenance cluster as this pack's Census Gazetteer records, not independent corroboration. The New York locality record's five-county hierarchy is retained as context only and is not counted as a boundary assertion. This page presents Who's On First's own published values; it is not the place to compare Who's On First against other sources — that comparison lives on "
